SUMMARY:Voice Agents Upgraded: New Speech Models and Agent Experience In F
 oundry
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nSpeech models let applications unde
 rstand and generate spoken language\, powering experiences like transcript
 ion\, real-time voice interaction\, and accessible conversational interfac
 es.\n\nIn this episode\, we'll walk through a live demo in the Foundry pla
 yground that shows how to build\, test\, monitor\, and optimize a voice ag
 ent from start to finish. We'll also cover the latest development in speec
 h-to-text\, text-to-speech\, and speech-to-speech models in Azure Speech i
 n Microsoft Foundry\, including new MAI models\, and how they make voice a
 gents more natural and responsive.\n---\n\n* Explore the Resources\nhttps:
 //github.com/microsoft/model-mondays\n* Read the Newsletter https://aka.ms
 /model-mondays/newsletter\n* Continue the conversation on the Discord http
 s://aka.ms/model-mondays/discord\n\n[eventID: 27565]
