SUMMARY:Build AI-powered soccer insights apps with AKS and ACA
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nLearn how to build and deploy AI-po
 wered applications that analyze football match and player data using AKS a
 nd ACA.\n\nUsing Premier League-inspired scenarios such as identifying tea
 m play styles\, analyzing counterattacks\, or uncovering player performanc
 e patterns\, we'll walk through a reference architecture for developing\, 
 deploying\, and operating AI applications and agents on Azure.\n\nAttendee
 s will leave with practical guidance and ideas they can extend into their 
 hackathon projects.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3162
 15145/
