SUMMARY:Grounding Agents in Business Context with Fabric IQ
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nLearn how to connect agents to busi
 ness data\, metrics\, and operational context with Fabric IQ. In this sess
 ion\, we'll explore how agents can use structured business knowledge to be
 tter understand entities\, relationships\, and processes across your organ
 ization.\n\nYou'll see how grounding agents in business context enables mo
 re accurate\, relevant\, and actionable responses.\n\n--------------------
 -----------------------------\n🔗 Resources: https://aka.ms/iq-series\n\
 n📌 This event is a part of a series\, learn more here: https://aka.ms/m
 icrosoftiqlive\n\n#MSFTReactor #learnconnectbuild #foundryiq #serverless #
 knowledgebases #agentdevelopment #retrieval #datagrounding #azureaifoundry
  #enterpriseknowledge
